{"parse": {"title": "AR-7", "pageid": 89277, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-6\" title=\"AR-6\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-7</span><a href=\"/wiki/AR-8\" title=\"AR-8\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">7</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B2.99.E7.B2.92.E4.B8.8E.E9.BB.84.E9.87.91\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"沙粒与黄金\">沙粒与黄金</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 沙粒与黄金</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Sand and Gold</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>题目前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>题目后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这座岛屿有许多特殊之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>而37在这之中也是格外特殊的一个。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_37celian1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_37celian1\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_37celian1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-1_4_at_37celian1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_37celian1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-1_4_at_37celian1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_37celian1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-1_4_at_37celian1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_37celian1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>她诞生起就拥有自己的数字，明白自己前行的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>当她在沙滩上讲述着那些不会消失的数，那些美妙的证明……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——那一瞬近乎永恒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>与此同时，我也深知了自己的黯淡和平凡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>让群星在应在的地方发光，仰望的人会继续仰望，没有什么不好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>收拾实验室，打理头发，列出物资清单，接待访客……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>不必让这些碎屑分去37的注意，她的时间应该留给更伟大的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但除去这些，37是一颗诞生不久、光芒崭亮的星星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>她不在意常识，会对许多新鲜事物好奇，贪玩又随心所欲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……就像每一位与我年龄相仿的普通玩伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37有她自己能做和要做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-508310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>而我也有应当做的事——验证37给出的答案。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抚摸着父亲留下的笔记本，闭上眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她记得许多具象的碎屑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在海滩上筛取细沙，打磨镜片时手指破皮的刺痛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>肉桂粉与鹰嘴豆的香气中回响的哼唱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船只破开水面，驶近岸边，在逐渐衰落的欢呼声中分崩离析。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，一切往前。越过翻涌的波涛，回到简陋的街巷之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是独属于苏菲亚的来自岛外的记忆，甚至要追溯到印象模糊的童年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不同于那颗孤悬于天中的明星，她生于具象，也属于这个黯淡的现象世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在记忆的糖罐中翻找着，试图找出一枚可供换取硬币的糖果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她是个勤奋，认真的好姑娘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因此，她在穷举整个罐子的小石块后，找到了那个可口的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>6333434533。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这并不只是一串数字，也不是数列，不是一段箴言，或者我们尚未了解的新知识……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>它是一句简谱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……简谱……？那是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个新鲜词儿并不在37的思考范围内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她惊讶地瞪大眼睛，明明白白地表示出好奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>人们常用这种方式标注乐律，这句简谱是一首歌的开头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>它在我的家乡很受欢迎，也是父亲最喜欢哼的曲调……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……他的确在这些题目中倾注了许多感情。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只要想起开头的音节，其后的乐句就自然地从喉咙里涌出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起初尚还磕绊、沙哑，但很快歌声变得流畅，在海滩上漾开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我知道数字可以是音乐，但我怎么没有早点想到——只差一点儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>简谱……我从没听说这种记谱法！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37并没有低落得太久，她很快就振作起来，真心实意地送出称赞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这是一支好听的歌儿，你唱得真好，苏菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>哦，真是皆大欢喜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你解开了谜，苏菲亚得到了父亲留下的歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>——我赢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>为什么？！我最初的设想是正确的，这串数字的确有深意！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>但你不认识简谱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>正如我所预见的，它从最开始就和你毫不相关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>它只是一首父亲留给女儿的、遥远的家乡歌谣，没有深刻的寓意，没有美妙的智慧，也没有超验的真理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>而你只是为了满足自己的好奇心，再次随心所欲地闹了一通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>令周围的一切都随之倾斜，不管它们是否会被搅乱或打碎——也可能被成就。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>这就是人们所称的天才。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>但不必担心，我说的这些都只是无足轻重的琐碎砂砾。而你是赫尔墨斯之星，是漫无尽头的沙滩上埋藏的黄金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>大家愿意陪着你玩耍，毕竟簇拥天才比跟随庸人要好得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但我用游戏的方式验证了它的正确性……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我还告诉了苏菲亚笔记本里一定有秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这算得上罕见的场面，37竟然没有立刻想出如何反驳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她沮丧地拧着眉毛望向苏菲亚，期望听见足够击倒210的评判结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我同意，210获得了胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>噢……好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原本支撑她挺直肩膀的期望全跑得一干二净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这次37没能马上打起精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她垂下脑袋，自顾自地踢起几片细沙，像海鸟一样把头埋到袍子里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这本笔记本有的，的确不是教典那般美妙的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这串数字确实也只有我能解出，因为其他人并不了解休。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>210率先预估到了结果，这点确凿无疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——但依照我个人的想法，37也完成了她的目标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这句话及时拯救了37脚下的沙滩，那儿已经有了浅浅的坑洼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站定在原地，等待苏菲亚接下去要讲的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>无论如何，最初的数字是37找到的。是她从尘埃中发掘了这段往事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>如果没有她的坚持，我不会再听到这首歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……我还记得37以前告诉我的，那个关于存在无限多质数的证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>唔……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚微笑着看向她。37不明所以地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我的父亲，休，和我一样的除错师，也是上一任负责处理外界事务的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>时日已久，这个名字已化为棱角分明的几何体，抑或一本尘封的笔记，一副摔破的眼镜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>就像37曾在沙滩上写下的公式，它早已被海浪抹去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>休也已经回到了本源之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但我们仍能听见他留下的这首歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>最初唱起这支歌的人或许也已经被时间冲刷，消逝，不复存在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但它仍然在响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>就像我们仍记得欧几里得两千多年前做出的那个证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>正如37所说，证明的长久在于它的简单与通用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这首曲子里也具有某种普遍性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>是的，它并非纯粹的数学理论，与本质也毫不相干——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>只是休留下的闪亮的碎屑，海滩上被映照而折射微光的砂砾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>那份普遍性令它仍然在时光中长存，越过了广袤的空间，来到此时此地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>让我们花一些时间，来听这首歌吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>只是听一听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>争执和分歧都在轻缓的呼吸声中消逝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海滩重归寂静，唯独一支歌儿回响。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-7"}}